    ["<Highlight>【非凡历史】</>为常驻结交人脉活动。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>概率信息</>\n<Highlight>[传说]</>品质人脉：基础概率为1.5%，综合概率（含保底）为3.74%\n包含：奥黛丽·霍尔、伦纳德·米切尔、佛尔思·沃尔、邓恩·史密斯、戴莉·西蒙妮、阿尔杰·威尔逊\n\n<Highlight>[史诗]</>品质人脉：基础概率为10%，综合概率（含保底）为22.56%\n包含：苏茜、洛薇雅·蒂芙尼、老尼尔、弗莱、弗兰克·李、班森·莫雷蒂、梅丽莎·莫雷蒂\n\n<Highlight>[常规道具]相关</>：基础概率为88.5%，综合概率（含保底）为73.70%\n包含：基础物质、聚合因子\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>结交细则</>\n1、每5次结交，必定获得一位史诗或以上的人脉。\n\n2、如果连续24次结交未获得传说人脉，则后续概率逐渐提升。\n每40次结交必定获得传说人脉。\n获得传说人脉后计数重置，概率恢复为基础概率。\n\n3、【非凡历史】的保底次数与其它活动独立计算，互不影响。\n\n4、可通过许愿提升结交获得对应人脉的概率。\n许愿后，获得传说人脉时，对应目标概率提高到80%。\n如果获得的传说人脉不是目标，则下次获得传说人脉必为许愿目标。\n许愿每周可生效2次，周一重置。\n每当结交人脉110次，可额外获得一次许愿次数。该次数不会被重置，且消耗优先级低于每周重置的次数。\n\n5、本活动每日可获得100次结交次数，最多可累计至700次。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重复获得人脉</>\n重复获得相同传说人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和10个投影片段。如果该传说人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为40个投影片段。\n重复获得相同史诗人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和2个投影片段。如果该史诗人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为2个投影片段。\n投影片段可用于在人脉商店兑换道具。"] = "<Highlight> [Beyonder History] </> is a permanent Befriending Connections activity. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Probability Information </> \n <Highlight> [Legendary] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 1.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 3.74%. \n Includes: Audrey Hall, Leonard Mitchell, Fors Wall, Dunn Smith, Daly Simone, Alger Wilson. \n \n <Highlight> [Epic] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 10%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 22.56%. \n Includes: Susie, Lovia Tiffany, Old Neil, Frye, Frank Lee, Benson Moretti, Melissa Moretti. \n \n <Highlight> [General Items] Related </>: Base probability is 88.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 73.70%. \n Includes: Basic Materials, Aggregation Factors. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Befriending Details </> \n 1. Every 5 Befriending attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain a Connection of Epic quality or higher. \n \n 2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection in 24 consecutive Befriending attempts, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. \n You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 Befriending attempts. \n After obtaining a Legendary Connection, the count resets, and the probability returns to the base probability. \n \n 3. The pity count for [Beyonder History] is calculated independently of other activities and does not affect each other. \n \n 4. You can increase the probability of obtaining a corresponding Connection through wishing. \n After wishing, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of the corresponding target increases to 80%. \n If the Legendary Connection obtained is not the target, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be the wish target. \n Wishing can be effective twice a week, resetting on Monday. \n Every time you perform 110 Befriending attempts, you can obtain an additional wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count. \n \n 5. In this activity, you can obtain 100 Befriending attempts per day, which can be accumulated up to 700 times. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Repeatedly Obtaining Connections </> \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Legendary Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 10 Projection Fragments. If that Legendary Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 40 Projection Fragments. \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Epic Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 2 Projection Fragments. If that Epic Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 2 Projection Fragments. \n Projection Fragments can be used to exchange for items in the Connection Shop.",
